# Paths are relative to the build context, which is the PARENT directory -
# see docker-compose.yml. Keeping the host virtualenvs and caches out of the
# context matters twice over: they are large, and a copied-in .venv points at
# host paths that `uv sync` inside the image would then have to fight.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.pyc
**/.git
